CXL
===

Qemu
====

Must enable CONFIG_CXL_REGION_INVALIDATION_TEST if Qemu, see [1][2][3].

[1] https://lore.kernel.org/all/CAGEDW0dVEk-QXuL=DPVvSP4t5cafz6N-r_SrCxgFnBfFOsixSA@mail.gmail.com/
[2] commit 6f08f902ef5c ("cxl: vm: Report error: cxl region0: Failed to synchronize CPU cache state (todo)")
[3] commit c3f026dc37c9 ("cxl: vm: kconfig: Fix error: cxl region0: Failed to synchronize CPU cache state")


